source_raw_tex:
\eqalign{\int_FY_k
&=\int_{F\cap G}X_k+a\hat\mu(F\setminus G)\cr
&=\int_{F\cap G}X_{k+1}+a\hat\mu(F\setminus G)\cr
&\le\int_{F\cap G}Y_{k+1}+\int_{F\setminus G}Y_{k+1}
=\int_FY_{k+1}.\,\,\Qed\cr}

