source_raw_tex:
\eqalign{H_n\cap\{\omega:\omega\in
&\dom\tilde X_{\tau},\,\tilde X_{\tau}(\omega)\le a\}\cr
&=\bigcup_{k\le n}\{\omega:\tau(\omega)=k,\,\omega\in\dom X_k,
  \,X_k(\omega)\le a\}
\in\Sigma_n.\cr}

